# What each entry needs, why it needs it, and what to do about it. A 'block'
# token that is missing takes the entry out of the menu; 'warn' installs
# anyway and says what is degraded; 'runtime' never blocks and shows up in
# `loadout status` as installed-but-not-in-the-path.
#
# 'when' limits a token to one platform, written as `uname -s`/`uname -m`.
# No field may contain a '|'.
#
# token              | severity | probe                     | when                 | why | fix | docs
claude               | block    | cmd:claude                | always               | plugin entries install into the Claude Code CLI; without it there is nothing to install into | install Claude Code, then re-run: see https://claude.com/claude-code | README.md
git                  | block    | cmd:git                   | always               | a marketplace is a git source and the CLI clones it | install git through your package manager | README.md
uv/pipx              | block    | anycmd:uv,pipx            | always               | this entry is a Python package and a Claude Code plugin cannot run a package manager | install uv (see https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) or pipx; avoid plain pip, which breaks the isolated environment | README.md
py313                | warn     | anycmd:python3.13,uv      | always               | the dashboard dollar tile depends on LiteLLM, which does not install on Python 3.14 or newer | install Python 3.13, or install uv, which provisions it for this tool alone | integrations/headroom/README.md
docker               | block    | cmd:docker                | platform:Darwin/x86_64 | there is no native wheel for Intel macOS; the ONNX path needs a container or a system ONNX Runtime | install Docker Desktop from https://docs.docker.com/desktop/ then re-run | integrations/headroom/README.md
anthropic_base_url   | runtime  | env:ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL    | always               | the proxy is installed but nothing routes through it until the agent is pointed at it | start it with `headroom proxy --port 8787` and export ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787 | integrations/headroom/README.md
curl/wget            | warn     | anycmd:curl,wget          | always               | the detector engine is not shipped with the plugin; the launcher downloads a platform binary from the release channel the first time a hook fires | install curl or wget through your package manager, or set IMPECCABLE_BIN to a preinstalled engine binary | integrations/impeccable/README.md
python3              | warn     | anycmd:python3,python      | always               | the design database is queried by a Python script inside the skill; without an interpreter every search fails and only the prose bodies remain | install Python 3.x through your package manager, or install uv, which can provision one | integrations/ui-ux-pro-max/README.md
